{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>中國海軍「吉祥方舟」號醫院船抵達科特迪瓦，展開友好訪問。</p><p></p><p>「吉祥方舟」號醫院船當地周三上午，停靠科特迪瓦經濟首都阿比讓，在七天的訪問中，「吉祥方舟」號醫院船上人員將為當地患者提供醫療服務，醫學交流分隊和巡診分隊，亦分別前往阿比讓軍隊醫院，和當地的大學等地，展開醫學交流和醫療巡診。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.IVORY.CN-1000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20260Q7uZO4L1j1792123797.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>今次是中國海軍醫院船首次訪問科特迪瓦。中國與科特迪瓦，在1983年3月正式建交，2024年9月雙方正式建立戰略夥伴關係。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T04:39:55.083413+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T01:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T05:37:58.512475+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T04:37:52.199149+00:00","content_hash":"b6dd11c3b19e8b241f00992bc7e6504c6773834ac397c5af9eb930140a2fa654","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}